    {
      "id": "a71ca506df9799065abf83cded65d6fd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "dc60dd0fd6ab6879a00ebb0e8c6126ef55b55d149085a74b0261ed3824a9251a",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "祝福の水",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9425922da8b2bf100fd6f42b283a55f1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "3eb2d400a70df520a55a2a8959c2e2b42a23a578ba1eb18ecc7140c0381f9bdd",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "三女神像が、静かに立っている。石に刻まれた双眸は、いつものように遠方を見ている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6aacb7679694db57ea0c28cb368727fe",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ecc37579fa8626ca40dd50778578b576bc99c1b9aa7d2cd544d0c9bb88ecca3f",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "三女神の肩から、瓶の水が流れ落ち、足元の池へ注がれている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "56ae180a42c1e11cd808690770be5f27",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        2,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "91d6ab01578098ba1fdb438a9962f969240d2d476518143cbc415c6809e8e3d9",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "「瓶から零れるのが女神の恩寵なら、私の上にも、降りてはこないだろうか……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "afab310d2cf5202a4c65831496391e18",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "75748633ddc80e1e4d7995efeac164e16170b1b025cd98eaac3b86d182b53000",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は目を閉じ、女神像の前で祈る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "563600a21fde974a7fe825ecac54219c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "459abcb867862b4dce3b8f61aafd173974826a8f518fb9ca3a647188704300a6",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "偶然だろうか。流れ落ちる水のうち、一滴がはねて、%YOU% の靴を濡らした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3cfcf5dbda90495847154f5422ed247f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "514b17925a44835b542a3349654db703b271efdd11e326a5019e16d10598686c",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "夢の訪問者",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cba7100306d0fb0fcea6f49098932402",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "b19cc2e9ac891a522f41b151e731ce459270e0f9c01de22d1558baca928d13d6",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "（かちり）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ef59a7350b54513867721a4104719654",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "1c96382ede044f5421fc84968a264e5b754afcdf67acd8d7e54bd67c961be83c",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "扉もないのに、掛け金の回る音がして、見慣れた顔が現れる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a24818fede5f36a94d3c0e9244c779f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "7c5f8e55152875095683918f8541578804c5747209a12a15890a32d33d84299f",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "微笑む面。水藍色の長髪。そして……身に纏う布の下に、隠れ、また現れる、彫像のように美しい肉体。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fd1f65d94195a8845d56449e957a7e47",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "712cb8d25ac54fed30a20e31cc6a1c058b5482681b6aea39b2aa5f5cb12b18a0",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "夢に顕れた女神は、「神」にふさわしい威厳も神蹟も見せない。その代わり、優しく %YOU% の傍らに座り、身を屈めて、%YOU% に口づける。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "98ff47891aa64a3eaba23653c34192cd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "3c05dfd4d1f774db02b7aa45d3724141f3657d00f36484b4911da5953c0fc939",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "その指が、そっと %YOU% の下へ伸び、硬い男根を握り、優しく撫で続ける……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b9440b6e0b3c7c7c074dcfd904061747",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "70e0168d60cb25d81705027e244b53e2dc2b5b498da474ea03a3fa9a226e9bef",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "その指が、そっと %YOU% の下へ伸び、愛液の流れる温かな秘所へと探り入る……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2017117e9a396aae55a2ec25a2923585",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "f53ebb1332eb356a3d3551618c4fe4018ae08c7cf276f23eb28f3039399bb128",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "本能に従う（神の胤を宿らせる）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7693b3a1cba99b6087bb755e0e42e2e2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "cf8c42ca910435657f2f29b49a3d177397e600c82f15f1b12d449f24ecf30fc7",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "唇と手だけでは、もはや %YOU% の高まった欲は満たされない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "08f0dab33811787391bb91dfd53fe215",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "8d8595432195bf8b9591b831f06fb70fea20fffb2e1fd892fccf40c399a26265",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "本能に駆られ、女神の無言の注視のなか、%YOU% は女神の手首を掴み、荒々しく押し伏せた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "01670903d205e2aaf94de3fa2ada1d99",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        0,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "bc0693260174a1ea5840ecace95d83e3ec2455ec5e1fb822c66d2f4e34ffe23f",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "抗いもなく、拒みもなく、ただ %YOU% の動きに身を委ねる。布が白い肢体から滑り落ち、かすかな音を立て——すぐ、%YOU% の獣じみた吐息に溶けた……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c7bc3e7ea3f6b10fe5d8c9f246267b17",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "128bf83a86b87fa9a4e28efe435e99c82921e2d2e82e5352efe2b989ee52a932",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "その思いが過った瞬間、何かが起きた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "127767720b5b7ffeab57fe523c419b51",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "41b7ce8e432f3478379f4a502a3c8efc60cdd0ce5e200d5ec4e1478d18f80a4e",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "夢のせいだろうか。女神の戯れだろうか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1af1433582999c902b69d9679554f687",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "47112a3a0323efabb77fcec1cba0f413ee56e628b34c299a938943dbd1d1af07",
      "sourceFileHash": "97246eb5922d0acee8272e16315080eccc3294225ffbf9fa240a5aea2813fa80",
      "originalText": "%YOU% の下半身に、己のものではないものが生えている。だが、眼前の艶やかな女神に比べれば、そんなことはどうでもよかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f5ed28cae358436bff5beba5265806e3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904100-Godolphin-Barb/love-341.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
